.DS_Store
# All real config is personal (and often secret-bearing): the canonical config.toml and every
# per-search [[searches]] file (e.g. midatl_tpm.toml). The tracked template is config.toml.example
# (ends in .example, so this glob doesn't match it).
*.toml
# Local pricing overrides: personal data (a pre-announcement rate, a negotiated deal), and the
# shipped model_pricing.json is the tracked one. Named explicitly because *.json is NOT blanket
# ignored the way *.toml is — without this line an override would show up as untracked and could
# be committed by accident.
model_pricing.local.json
*.backup
*.db
# SQLite WAL-mode sidecars (jobs.db-wal / jobs.db-shm) — transient
*.db-*
uploads/
searches/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
*~
*.log
.claude/
.vscode/
# Emacs autosave (#file#) and lock (.#file) temp copies — stops an editor scratch copy of
# the secret-bearing config.toml (API key + profile) from being accidentally staged. (*~
# backup files are already covered above.)
\#*#
.#*
